          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: 'Prioritize winning at least 5 tricks to avoid a zero-score hand. If your hand is weak, use the Manni to find a trump suit.',
          intermediate: "Contract bidding is crucial. If you see your hand has many high cards across suits, a 'No-Trump' (Nullo) or 'Grand' contract is more effective than a specific trump suit.",
          advanced: 'Tracking the Manni: If you saw the cards in the Manni before they were swapped, you have critical information about what cards your opponents are now holding.',
          tips: [
            'The Ace and King of the trump suit are the most powerful cards for securing your base 5 tricks.',
            "In tournaments, playing conservatively to simply 'be on the board' is often better than aggressive bidding.",
