        prompts: {
          human: 'Welcome to Hornafjarðarmanni, the pride of south-east Iceland. Bid your contract carefully—trump suit, No-Trump, or Grand. Then exchange cards with the face-down Manni to optimize your hand. Play 16 tricks and score points for each trick won above four. Regional tournaments have preserved this game for generations.',
          ai: 'Game: Hornafjarðarmanni (Icelandic Manni). 3-player trick-taking. Setup: 52-card deck, 16 cards per player, 4-card Manni. Bidding: Player left of dealer bids (Trump/No-Trump/Grand). Contract winner exchanges up to 7 cards with Manni. Play: 16 tricks, follow suit, highest trump/led suit wins. Scoring: 1 point per trick above 4. Target: 30-50 points.',
